title: "One O channel with a per-channel execution node, issue 8486 (revision 2)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Unmanaged
    lg1: Designated
    lg2: Gateway
    lg3: Moving
    lg4: Breaks NoDuplicate or SingleWriter
    lg5: Breaks CurrentStore in some cases
    lg6: Path to the CurrentStore or NoDuplicate or SingleWriter bug
  }
  class lg0 tan
  class lg1 teal
  class lg2 blue
  class lg3 pink
  class lg4 breaks
  class lg5 mayBreak
  class lg6 bugPath
  s0: No owner row, the gateway serves (no node set)
  s1: No owner row, the gateway serves (no node set, the hub's file says otherwise, 1 file edit so far)
  s2: No owner row, the gateway serves (set to the designated node, 1 file edit so far)
  s3: No owner row, the gateway serves (set to the designated node, the hub's file says otherwise, 2 file edits so far)
  s4: No owner row, the gateway serves (set to the designated node, the hub's file says otherwise, 2 file edits so far), an input waits at the gateway
  s5: No owner row, the gateway serves (set to the designated node, the hub's file says otherwise, 2 file edits so far), an input is kept for the designated node
  s6: Home is the designated node (set to the designated node, the hub's file says otherwise, 2 file edits so far), an input is handed to the designated node
  s7: Home is the designated node (set to the designated node, the hub's file says otherwise, 2 file edits so far), turn runs on the designated node
  s8: Home is the designated node (no node set, 2 file edits so far), turn runs on the designated node
  s9: Home is the designated node (no node set, 2 file edits so far), an input waits at the gateway, turn runs on the designated node
  s10: Home is the designated node (no node set, 2 file edits so far), an input is kept for the gateway, turn runs on the designated node
  s11: Home is the designated node (no node set, 2 file edits so far), an input is kept for the gateway, old home asked to end, turn runs on the designated node
  s12: Home is the designated node (no node set, 2 file edits so far), an input is kept for the gateway, old home did not answer, turn runs on the designated node
  s13: Home is the gateway (no node set, 2 file edits so far), an input is handed to the gateway, turn runs on the designated node (old session)
  s14: Home is the gateway (no node set, 2 file edits so far), an input is handed to the gateway, idle session on the designated node
  s15: Home is the gateway (no node set, 2 file edits so far), turn runs on the designated node (old session) and the gateway
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: an operator edits one node's config file
  s1 --> s2: the hub copies its setting to the database
  s2 --> s3: an operator edits one node's config file
  s3 --> s4: you send a message
  s4 --> s5: the gateway puts the input into shared custody
  s5 --> s6: the input is handed to the node that owns the channel
  s6 --> s6: a node reads the owner row again
  s6 --> s7: the home starts the turn
  s7 --> s8: the hub copies its setting to the database
  s8 --> s9: you send a message
  s9 --> s10: the gateway puts the input into shared custody
  s10 --> s11: the old home is asked to end its session
  s11 --> s12: the request's deadline passes without an answer
  s12 --> s13: the owner row moves to the new home
  s13 --> s13: a node reads the owner row again
  s13 --> s14: the answer reaches Discord
  s13 --> s15: the home starts the turn
